// to the data, so its corners are off-screen. Drawing it as a single
// QRectF would produce no visible pixels. Instead, draw the four sides
// as separate lines clipped to the widget — that way the user always
// sees the visible portion of the bounding box.
{
    double x_lo = mapX(BMIN);
    double x_hi = mapX(BMAX);
